{{infobox entity
 | hidden = yes
 | dlc    = a
 | name   = Black Poop
}}
[[file:Black Poop.png|54px]]
* {{dlc+|a+}} Darkens the current room as if {{I|Glaucoma}} was active for a few seconds when destroyed. This effect gets overlapped by {{I|No. 2}} and vice-versa.{{dlc-}}
