== {{dlc+|a+}} White Poop ==
{{infobox entity
 | hidden = yes
 | dlc    = a+
 | name   = White Poop
}}
[[file:White Poop.png|54px]]
* Has the same chance to drop [[coin]]s, [[heart]]s, and {{t|Petrified Poop}} when destroyed as regular poop.
* Will be spawned if Isaac has {{i|Hallowed Ground}} and is injured or uses {{i|The Poop}}.
** {{dlc+|r}} Can also be thrown by {{c|Tainted ???}} or with {{i|IBS}}.{{dlc-}}
** Can also replace random obstacles when using {{i|D12}}.
* White poop is surrounded by an aura. While standing within the aura, tear delay is halved, it has a high chance to block damage like the {{i|Cone Head}} item, {{dlc|r}} [[damage]] is increased by 25%, and tears become [[Tear Effects#Homing Tears|homing]].
* The aura disappears if the poop is destroyed.
* {{dlc|r}} Harder to destroy than normal poop, though not as durable as golden poop.
{{dlc-}}

== {{dlc+|r}} Giant Poop ==
{{infobox entity
 | hidden = yes
 | dlc    = r
 | name   = Giant Poop
}}
[[File:Giant Poop.png|128px]]
* Occurs only in 4 rare room layouts in {{s|Dross}}.
* Requires a large amount of tears to destroy.
* Drops different [[pickups]] when hit.
** Can drop [[coins]], {{E|Red Heart}}s, {{E|Soul Heart}}s, {{E|Eternal Heart}}s, and the {{t|Petrified Poop}} trinket.
** Drops four times pickups when holding the Petrified Poop.
* Using an [[Infested!]] pill on it will spawn 4 blue spiders (8 with a [[Pills#Horse Pills|Horse Pill]]) and decrease the poop's stage by 1.
* Unlike with other poops, breaking this poop variant whilst having the {{tf|Oh Crap}} transformation won't restore any health.

