== Trivia ==
* Isaac's creator, Edmund McMillen, has mentioned having IBS in real life — as well as Isaac having it in-game. This could explain the large variety of poops throughout the game.
* Edmund McMillen confirmed that red poop causes damage "because it is made out of AIDS".

