== Bugs ==
{{bug|If a poop is destroyed by an item pedestal spawning, collecting the item then leaving and re-entering the room will cause the poop to reappear, dropping its reward twice. This is especially remarkable for golden poops.}}
{{bug|If a poop is pushed by an explosion to fill in a gap, a bridge will be created even if the poop survives the explosion. This way, it is possible to fill more than one gap with a durable poop such as golden poop.}}

